  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity of Community-Based Gender-Based Violence Prevention and Response in Santa Cruz Province, Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to gender equality by empowering female adolescents and youth aged 12 to 21 in exercising their rights and strengthening the system to respond, mitigate and prevent GBV in the municipalities of Santa Cruz de la Sierra, Montero and La Guardia- (&#xc131;&#xacfc; 1) &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xae30;&#xbc18;&#xc758; &#xc820;&#xb354; &#xc804;&#xd658;&#xc801; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xc5ec;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xb0a8;&#xc131; &#xccad;&#xc18c;&#xb144;&amp;amp;middot;&#xccad;&#xb144;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; GBV &#xc608;&#xbc29; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
  (&#xc131;&#xacfc; 2) GBV &#xacf5;&#xb3d9; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd488;&#xc9c8;&amp;amp;middot;&#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;
  (&#xc131;&#xacfc; 3) &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc815;&#xbd80;&#xc758; &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xc801; GBV &#xc608;&#xbc29; &#xbc0f; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xc815;&#xcc45;&amp;amp;middot;&#xc81c;&#xb3c4; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a Gender Transformative initiative aimed at promoting gender equality by raising awareness of women&amp;#39;s rights and dismantling discriminatory social and cultural norms in the Santa Cruz department of Bolivia. It is expected to contribute to SDGs 5 and 10, and play a significant role in the effective implementation of related Bolivian laws and policies. The project supports the local community and government in collaborating to prevent and respond to the risks of gender-based violence (GBV). Specifically, it empowers young women and youth to become agents of change in GBV prevention and response by strengthening community members&amp;#39; capacities, establishing comprehensive and effective public and private GBV response systems, and enhancing the local government&amp;#39;s integrated GBV prevention and response frameworks. Through these efforts, the project aims to dismantle deeply rooted discriminatory social and cultural norms, reduce GBV, and promote gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
